154
00:10:36.500 --> 00:10:39.666
[clears throat] My mom won't eat here.
She says it's not sanitary.

155
00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:41.583
I mean, I don't really like eating here,

156
00:10:41.666 --> 00:10:45.041
