-[Mom] I can't. It's gonna see me.

465
00:29:52.666 --> 00:29:54.125
Go quick. Hide behind the couch.

466
00:29:54.208 --> 00:29:55.625
[Mom] I can't. I can't move.

467
00:29:55.708 --> 00:29:57.750
-I cannot move from here!
