468
00:29:57.833 --> 00:30:00.416
[Mom] Kayla, help me!
I'm gonna go and hide.

469
00:30:00.500 --> 00:30:02.333
-I'm gonna go and hide!
-No! No!

470
00:30:02.416 --> 00:30:04.041
