-[rat shrieking]

488
00:30:39.458 --> 00:30:41.166
-[narrator] Meat.
-No, no, no!

489
00:30:41.250 --> 00:30:43.166
-[rat shrieking]
-[Mom screaming]

490
00:30:43.250 --> 00:30:44.750
[Kayla] Shut the fucking door!

491
00:30:45.666 --> 00:30:47.625
