-[Mom crying hysterically]

501
00:31:12.500 --> 00:31:14.250
[narrator] Choose or die.

502
00:31:14.333 --> 00:31:17.708
[Mom sobbing] Kayla,
I can't hold the door!

503
00:31:17.791 --> 00:31:20.416
