790
00:47:01.333 --> 00:47:03.333
[both grunting]

791
00:47:04.208 --> 00:47:05.875
[Kayla sobbing]

792
00:47:06.500 --> 00:47:07.666
[Kayla grunting]

793
00:47:09.208 --> 00:47:10.500
[both grunting]

794
00:47:14.833 --> 00:47:16.250
